licensed under the MIT license. The full upstream LICENSE is installed
as /usr/share/doc/ghostty/LICENSE (possibly compressed).

Bundled dependencies, fonts, and themes have their own copyright holders
and license terms, not uniformly MIT. License/notice files discovered in
the signed source and fetched dependency cache are preserved under
/usr/share/doc/ghostty/bundled-licenses/ with their relative paths.
The upstream build.zig.zon and build.zig.zon.txt record dependency sources.
This collection is an aid to review, not a claim of a completed license audit.
Review the source and transitive dependencies before redistributing.

